# Source of truth

- `docs/PRODUCT_SPEC.md` is the authoritative product specification.
- `docs/MVP.md` defines P0/P1 scope for the first geographic pilot.
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` defines technical structure and stack choices.
- When in doubt, prefer the spec over ad-hoc suggestions.

# Scope control

Do NOT implement features listed under "Vad Turbok INTE ska göra i MVP" in PRODUCT_SPEC §62:

- forum, messaging, followers, social feed, likes, challenges, badges
- turn-by-turn navigation, SOS, live tracking
- bokningsplattform, marknadsplats, automatisk AI-guide

# Milestone discipline

- Complete P0 end-to-end before P1.
- Do not start P2/P3 before P0 works.
- Follow milestone order in README and MILESTONE_1.

# Design principle

Ask before building: "Hjälper detta användaren planera en bättre tur eller bevara kunskap som hjälper nästa vandrare?"
